# Build context for docker/images/Dockerfile. Nothing secret or machine-local enters an image:
# env files, certificates and MCP config are runtime inputs, never build inputs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.angular
**/.nitro
**/.turbo
**/.docusaurus
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
certs
docker/stack/env/*.env
.claude
.cursor
.vscode
vendor
project-context
apps/developer-portal*
docs
